{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "44210198589782c137bdb7f63fe24d85e9b7b26c3a9aeea74ac8a3770066ffd7", "ja": "舞台袖にて　～出番待ちの一幕～", "zh": "舞台侧边　～等待出场的一幕～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "229f9039a7ef8734a016f508ff60fe086e88d3172c502a555d5813a305c9ee40", "ja": "ライブ序盤から盛り上がる観客とコンサート\r\nライトの光に、舞台袖で待機している恵美\r\nたちも大喜び。観客に負けないぐらい盛り\r\n上げようと気合いを入れ、輝くステージに\r\n飛び出していく。", "zh": "在舞台侧边待命的惠美她们，\n见到演唱会刚开场观众就热情如火，\n以及现场的萤光棒光海，感到非常开心。\n为了拿出不输观众的热情，\n她们鼓起气势，跃上璀璨的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "3663037de2d18043bf8e47d7c6c7d67973999e88251d10f53a3f34094c8c377c", "ja": "うわ～！　ステージ、超盛り上がってる！\n1曲目から、ず～っとノリノリじゃん。にゃはは♪", "zh": "哇～！舞台上的气氛超热烈！\n从第一首歌开始，就一～直很嗨耶，呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "3ca89b96c4cbc8d0ec23dc7edf5abb361d217fa4bf67ac62a5de039033fc49bd", "ja": "劇場と雰囲気が違うから、緊張してたけど……ファンの\nみんなの声を聞いたら、負けられないっ！て感じだね！", "zh": "因为气氛和在剧场时不一样，我本来还很紧张……\n但听到粉丝们的声音后，我开始觉得自己也不能输！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "0bb057be5d672afcb3b55133950a49b046c822c5f59a01fa706f4a1cd8860969", "ja": "そうね。このファンのみなさんの、温かい声援……。\n私たちも、後押ししてもらいましょう！", "zh": "是啊，粉丝们的声援是如此温暖……\n我们等等也去接受大家的鼓舞吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "deff74022eb0ed66a0b6eae0ff5f1543a7e235e708959cff0f526d89e1ad924a", "ja": "あ……ねえ、みんな見て！\nここから見える客席、すっごくキレイだよ♪", "zh": "啊……欸，大家快看！\n从这里往观众席看过去，景色很美喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "087cf12f25ef6382d98dd736e15f368245f1562f6595aca1e27a8043dfa278e1", "ja": "うわ～、ホントだ！　コンサートライトが揺れて、\n光が波みたい……なんか、スゴいな～……。", "zh": "哇～真的耶！摇摆的萤光棒，\n形成一道道光浪……感觉好壮观……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "dfefd495f817328d3d0ac859c7c1b44a737e04c94ede2d5cb246289e4f191998", "ja": "お客さん、すごく楽しんでるね……。\nうう……アタシ、なんか泣けてきちゃったよ～！", "zh": "观众们很享受演唱会呢……\n呜呜……我有种想哭的感觉～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "e11b9d651d3f2b92f861380990b6b45f5a452dd18f56e8dfacf4a83ac456d13a", "ja": "……そうね、私も胸がいっぱい。でも、私たちの出番\nはまだこれから。涙は最後まで取っておきましょう？", "zh": "……是啊，我心里也充满了感动。\n不过，我们待会才要出场，眼泪就留到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "087eb9a000ad9b709502e7cd70a8f672277fedea2e0dbce798a9f4f906ccba20", "ja": "そうだよ、恵美！　アタシたちも全力で突っ走らないと\nお客さんに負けちゃうからね。気合い入れていこう！", "zh": "就是说啊，惠美！我们也要使出全力奔驰，\n不然会输给观众喔。鼓起干劲上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "5b97efa7b74e5b859852ddf183154cc16f09c51bb3aa1afbc1297de20d74b525", "ja": "この光に負けないくらいかぁ……うん、そうだね！\nみんなが私たちのステージ、楽しんでくれるといいな♪", "zh": "不输这些光辉吗……嗯，说得对！\n希望我们的表演能让大家全心投入♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "fe2cd2a6632c34b031bd7b4ae5c0f1fef81d133160e405ec04122921f369cf53", "ja": "だよね……。ぐすっ、よし！　アタシもファンの\nみんなを、もっとノリノリにさせるぞー！", "zh": "没有错……呜，好！\n我也要让粉丝们更加嗨翻天──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "23806aa0f9b2e873d02050785ce09e031ec646cf33660192652377e48acb1577", "ja": "そうそう！　そうでなくちゃね♪\nそれじゃ……そろそろ行こうか？", "zh": "对啊对啊！这样才像话嘛♪\n那么……我们差不多该登台了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "55983e6ff1aeeacce4e1187f988cce62b33f8ea3219c011b735b5b691ba4ae34", "ja": "うふふ、そうね。\n私たちの心を、会場のみなさんに届けましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n去把我们的心意传达给大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_04_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "fda2f35e51b0e97139a24674a80d36cbda5dce9130d77d1feac384611dd70ab2", "ja": "それじゃ、みんな行こう！\n私たちの、輝くステージへ！", "zh": "那么，大家一起上吧！\n登上我们的璀璨舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
